1. Definitions

"Software" means the Agent Desk application, including its executable,
runtime files, dashboard assets, and documentation, but excluding the Plugin
SDK materials identified in LICENSE-SDK and third-party components.

"Plugin" means a declarative plugin package that conforms to the Agent Desk
plugin manifest schema and is distributed through the Agent Desk marketplace
or loaded by the Software.

"Licensor" means the copyright holder named above.

